#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:3
#: fdf0cf5e0eb442fc8454a80895ffbe73
msgid "**ARCHIVED: no longer supported**"
msgstr "**已归档：不再支持**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:7
#: c5ddca706ed546c5ab6d3222d1dc2362
msgid "Toshiba CAN ESCs"
msgstr "Toshiba CAN 电调"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:12
#: d974256b507149049300ec46048e9206
msgid ""
"ToshibaCAN ESCs are high-end ESCs that allow control and feedback using a "
"custom CAN protocol.  Some additional specifications:"
msgstr "ToshibaCAN 电调是高端电调，通过自定义 CAN 协议进行控制和反馈。部分附加规格："

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:14
#: ef6ecd7f69e04aeb80ac800bb47770e4
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"FOC which should result in about 10% longer flight times while also being "
"quieter than non-FOC ESCs"
msgstr "FOC 控制，飞行时间比非 FOC 电调延长约 10%，同时噪音更小"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:15
#: ff147ff1b9654685a2bca33eabb38274
msgid "Up to 7S batteries (future versions are planned for up to 12S), 50Amps"
msgstr "最高支持 7S 电池（未来版本计划支持最高 12S），50A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:16
#: 01d0403646e64bec9f94760abc629719
msgid "Up to 12 motors"
msgstr "最多支持 12 个电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:17
#: d8780a9a24f1440d81083a03f7d2bcff
msgid "Fast sync issue recovery time (100ms to 150ms)"
msgstr "快速同步问题恢复时间（100ms 至 150ms）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:18
#: 0228f98ac9aa4fac8208c78834422c9d
msgid "Relatively lightweight"
msgstr "相对轻量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:19
#: dfef5234a9aa46a8bc60ed632f749118
msgid "Designed and manufactured in Japan"
msgstr "在日本设计制造"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:23
#: fd56baa366794d229133faa8fcb94fba
msgid ""
"Support for these ESCs is included in Copter-4.0 (and higher), Plane-3.10 "
"(and higher) and Rover-3.5 (and higher)"
msgstr "Copter-4.0（及更高版本）、Plane-3.10（及更高版本）和 Rover-3.5（及更高版本）支持这些电调"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:26
#: 8b3a50a96d34472094dfc09d948f3940
msgid "Where To Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:28
#: c5666f1be6274a2ba4f813258ee79e7b
msgid ""
"These ESCs can be purchased by directly contacting the following companies "
"(replace \"AT\" with \"@\" in the email addresses)"
msgstr "这些电调可直接联系以下公司购买（将邮件地址中的「AT」替换为「@」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:30
#: aa44a93336294863825627d58a2c0343
msgid "Toshiba USA: Alan.Li AT taec.toshiba.com"
msgstr "Toshiba 美国：Alan.Li AT taec.toshiba.com"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:31
#: fec96773abdd47bea75a3d82ff5b37b0
msgid "Hikari Alphax Japan: masaki_nakamura AT h-ax.com"
msgstr "Hikari Alphax 日本：masaki_nakamura AT h-ax.com"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:33
#: 3f24d70b4e8f4f55855a2c597ed1ccf3
msgid ""
"CAN splitter boards are also required, the boards used in the above video "
"were provided by `EAMS Lab <http://elab.co.jp/>`__ but these are also not "
"readily available for sale."
msgstr ""
"还需要 CAN 分线板，上述视频中使用的分线板由 `EAMS Lab <http://elab.co.jp/>`__ 提供，但这些板子也无法轻易购买到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:36
#: e1eca77532404f3197478c760aae9873
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:42
#: 4e70cf5fe44241cda7ff85e878c28e43
msgid ""
"ESCs should be daisy chained together using CAN splitter boards and then one"
" 4-pin CAN cable should be connected to the autopilot's CAN port.  Note that"
" the last splitter board has a terminator (i.e. no port) on one side."
msgstr ""
"电调应通过 CAN 分线板串联连接，然后用一根 4 芯 CAN 线连接到飞控的 CAN 端口。注意最后一个分线板的一侧有终端电阻（即无端口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:46
#: dd46651c301546f9b0a56d6d23cb2a6a
msgid ""
"If using a Cube autopilot, the CAN1 and CAN2 labels are reversed.  These "
"instructions assume the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port which is "
"labelled \"CAN2\" on Cube autopilots"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Cube 飞控，CAN1 和 CAN2 标签是反的。这些说明假设电调连接到 CAN1 端口，在 Cube 飞控上标注为「CAN2」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:52
#: 40a5a544819245759ad4fe0b23ffef4c
msgid ""
"Set the dip switches on each ESC to specify its unique number.  This number "
"also maps the ESC to an equivalent PWM output on the back of the autopilot."
"  For example ESC 1 will react just like a normal PWM ESC connected to the "
"autopilot's MAIN OUT 1.  By default this mapping also matches the "
":ref:`motor order diagrams <Copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`."
msgstr ""
"在每个电调上设置拨码开关以指定其唯一编号。该编号同时将电调映射到飞控背面对应的 PWM 输出。例如，电调 1 的响应与连接到飞控 MAIN OUT 1 "
"的普通 PWM 电调相同。默认情况下，此映射也与 :ref:`电机顺序图 <Copter:connect-escs-and-motors>` 匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:53
#: c5f1e7c57a9847948df9e48f419ff444
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 3 (ToshibaCAN)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 3（ToshibaCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:54
#: d651e4f373b64e61ab0ef66ccc358a65
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver) to specify that "
"the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动器），以指定 ESC 连接到 CAN1 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:58
#: 594b13adf80f492b8983bf02099efa4b
msgid ""
"Set ``SERVOx_MIN`` = 1000 and ``SERVOx_MAX`` = 2000 for each ESC connected "
"(``x`` corresponds to the ESC number) so ArduPilot uses an output range that"
" matches the ESCs input range"
msgstr ""
"为每个已连接的 ESC 设置 ``SERVOx_MIN`` = 1000、``SERVOx_MAX`` = 2000（``x`` 对应 ESC "
"编号），使 ArduPilot 输出范围与 ESC 输入范围匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:62
#: 32a25016dc4846c789651abcf483dbf2
msgid "Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "日志记录与报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:64
#: a9af093417104e6b99883593efe28907
msgid ""
"ToshibaCAN ESCs provide information back to the autopilot which is recorded "
"in the autopilot's onboard log's ESCn messages and can be viewed in any "
":ref:`ArduPilot compatible log viewer <common-logs>`.  This information "
"includes:"
msgstr ""
"ToshibaCAN 电调向飞控反馈信息，记录在飞控机载日志的 ESCn 消息中，可通过任何 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容日志查看器 "
"<common-logs>` 查看。这些信息包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:66
#: ab22dc928b264ad68f15ce651d7d5b3a
msgid "RPM"
msgstr "转速"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:67
#: af9089a6f672452d93e508103cdd9528
msgid "Voltage"
msgstr "电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:68
#: 2f13e1a0abaa44bd9015691caa84d6b0
msgid "Current"
msgstr "电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:69
#: a9c3dbae8e0f415f97841887dcbdb2c8
msgid "ESC Temperature"
msgstr "电调温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:70
#: e67dc30c2b164b72ae5c933c7327312d
msgid "Total Current"
msgstr "总电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:71
#: 7135ae780e944015ab2ae796110e66c5
msgid ""
"Motor Temperature (if the optional motor temperature sensor is connected)"
msgstr "电机温度（如果连接了可选的电机温度传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:73
#: 2249a3dcb9a34fee81db09035726d6af
msgid ""
"The RCOU messages are also written to the onboard logs which hold the "
"requested output level sent to the ESCs expressed as a number from 1000 "
"(meaning stopped) to 2000 (meaning full output)."
msgstr "RCOU 消息也会写入机载日志，记录发送给 ESC 的请求输出电平，以 1000（表示停止）到 2000（表示全速输出）的数值表示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:75
#: 6e33e015edcb41bd98a9f71a58f73868
msgid ""
"This information (except the motor temperature) can also be viewed in real-"
"time using a ground station.  If using the Mission Planner go to the Flight "
"Data screen's status tab and look for esc1_rpm."
msgstr ""
"这些信息（电机温度除外）也可通过地面站实时查看。如果使用 Mission Planner，转到飞行数据界面的状态标签页，查找 esc1_rpm。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:83
#: 2fbfcb1fa3684f55937619544bd5fcdb
msgid ""
"Sending ESC data to the GCS requires using MAVLink2.  Please check the "
"appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter is 2 (where \"x\" is the serial port "
"number used for the telemetry connection)."
msgstr ""
"将 ESC 数据发送到 GCS 需要使用 MAVLink2。请检查相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数是否为 2（其中 「x」 "
"是用于数传连接的串口编号）。"

